{"seq":5,"slug":"forestry","title":"林学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry","introMarkdown":"# 林学 简介\n\n林学研究的是森林这一陆地上最复杂、最重要的生态系统：它如何生长、如何被人类培育与利用、又如何在气候变化的时代被保护和经营。森林覆盖了地球约 31% 的陆地面积，既是木材、纸张、果实和药材的来源，也是固碳、涵养水源、保持土壤和庇护生物多样性的巨大基础设施。林学的任务，就是用科学的方法理解森林、培育森林、保护森林，并在\"利用\"与\"保护\"之间找到可持续的平衡。\n\n这门学科的特殊之处在于它的时间尺度。一棵杉木从种子到可采伐往往需要二三十年，一片栎树林的成熟可能跨越上百年。这意味着林业的每一个决策都是面向未来的——你今天种下的树，收获者可能是你的孙辈。因此林学不只是生物学的应用，更是一门关于\"长期规划\"和\"代际责任\"的学问。它要求从业者既懂植物生理与生态规律，又能进行经济核算、空间规划和风险管理。\n\n本学习空间将林学的核心内容组织为四个章节。**第一章 森林生态学** 建立理解森林的科学基础，讲解森林的结构、演替规律、物质与能量循环，以及生物多样性的意义。**第二章 造林与营林** 进入\"培育\"的实践层面，讨论树种选择、育苗、造林技术与森林抚育，这是把荒地变成森林的工程。**第三章 森林保护** 关注森林面临的威胁，涵盖森林病虫害、森林火灾的防控原理，以及森林健康监测。**第四章 森林经营与利用** 探讨如何科学地经营森林资源，包括森林测计、采伐与更新、森林碳汇与可持续经营。\n\n学习林学最有效的方式是把理论带到野外。建议你找一片身边的林地——城市公园的人工林、郊外的次生林或山区的天然林——反复观察它一年四季的变化，记录树种、林下植被、土壤和动物的痕迹。当你能用本课程的概念去\"读懂\"一片真实的森林时，这些知识才真正属于你。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forest-ecology","title":"森林生态学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-ecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forest-structure-and-composition","title":"大学林学 — 森林的结构与组成","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-ecology/forest-structure-and-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"forest-succession-and-dynamics","title":"大学林学 — 森林演替与动态","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-ecology/forest-succession-and-dynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nutrient-cycling-and-ecosystem-services","title":"大学林学 — 森林的物质循环与生态服务","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-ecology/nutrient-cycling-and-ecosystem-services"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"silviculture","title":"造林与营林","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/silviculture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"species-selection-and-site-matching","title":"大学林学 — 树种选择与适地适树","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/silviculture/species-selection-and-site-matching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nursery-and-afforestation-techniques","title":"大学林学 — 育苗与造林技术","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/silviculture/nursery-and-afforestation-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forest-tending-and-management","title":"大学林学 — 森林抚育与经营管理","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/silviculture/forest-tending-and-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"forest-protection","title":"森林保护","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-protection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pest-and-disease-management","title":"大学林学 — 森林病虫害防治","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-protection/pest-and-disease-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"forest-fire-prevention","title":"大学林学 — 森林防火","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-protection/forest-fire-prevention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forest-health-monitoring","title":"大学林学 — 森林健康监测","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forest-protection/forest-health-monitoring"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"forestry-management","title":"森林经营与利用","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forest-mensuration-and-inventory","title":"大学林学 — 森林测计与资源调查","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/forest-mensuration-and-inventory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"harvesting-and-forest-regeneration","title":"大学林学 — 采伐与森林更新","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/harvesting-and-forest-regeneration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forest-carbon-and-sustainable-management","title":"大学林学 — 森林碳汇与可持续经营","url":"/education/university/agriculture/forestry/forestry-management/forest-carbon-and-sustainable-management"}]}]}